      <div id="quizArea">
        <form id="quizForm">
          <div class="question"><b>Q1. What does :hover mean?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> Style when mouse goes over element</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Style when page loads</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Style when clicked</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Style always</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. Which property makes Hand Cursor on button?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> cursor: pointer;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> mouse: hand;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> pointer: cursor;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> cursor: hand;</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. Which property makes Hover Smooth?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> transition: 0.3s;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> smooth: 0.3s;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> animation: 0.3s;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> hover: smooth;</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. What is Outline Button?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> White background + Colored border only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> No border at all</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> Only text, no button</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> Black button</label></div>
