          <div class="question"><b>Q7. What is correct order of Link States?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> :link → :visited → :hover → :active</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> :hover → :link → :visited → :active</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> :active → :hover → :link → :visited</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> :visited → :link → :active → :hover</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q8. :visited means?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="a"> Link already clicked before</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="b"> Link never clicked</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="c"> Mouse is over link</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="d"> Link is being clicked</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q9. How to make a Link look like a Button?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="a"> &lt;a class="btn"&gt;Contact Us&lt;/a&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="b"> &lt;button&gt;Contact Us&lt;/button&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="c"> &lt;link&gt;Contact Us&lt;/link&gt;</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="d"> &lt;a&gt;Contact Us&lt;/a&gt; only</label></div>
